  "rewardData": "Kiss and Tell__$10.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Stick Around__$25.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Wear the Love__$50.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Tote-al Thanks__$100.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Welcome to the Club__$200.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Goodie Box__$300.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Better Box__$500.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | It's a Date__$1,000.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | ",
